- **Dark mode support:** No evidence of user-toggleable dark mode on the storefront.
- **Gradient usage:** Minimal in the core storefront; brand illustration (mascot art) carries most of the visual personality rather than gradients.
- **Color accessibility:** Star-rating gold-on-white and price-grey-on-white are the two spots most likely to sit near WCAG AA contrast minimums; primary CTA orange-on-white/white-on-orange combinations are generally solid.

