- **Pricing model:** Overwhelmingly **one-time "lifetime deal" (LTD)** pricing — a signature AppSumo mechanic where buyers pay once for perpetual (or long-term-tiered) access to normally-subscription SaaS tools, explicitly marketed as "no monthly fees."
